      "id": "ideas",
      "title": "ideas.txt",
      "tone": "plain",
      "body": "RUNNING LIST — not briefs, just things worth trying\n\n· A venue newsletter that is actually the playlist\n· Shoot the menu once a season, not once a week\n· Every campaign gets a tracked link before it gets a caption\n· Stop making 30s films nobody watches past 6s\n· The report should fit on one page or it isn't a report\n· If a format works, repeat it until it stops working\n\n(Some of these turned into projects. Most didn't.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "dont-open",
      "title": "dont_open.txt",
      "tone": "easter-egg",
      "body": "You opened it.\n\nFine. Here is the actual secret:\n\nNone of this is complicated. Decide who it's for.\nMake something they'd want. Put it where they are.\nThen check whether it worked and be honest about the answer.\n\nEverything else is production."
    },
    {
      "id": "read-me",
      "title": "read_me_first.txt",
      "tone": "accent",
      "body": "Welcome.\n\nThe Work window is the portfolio — open a project to see it full size.\n\nIn a hurry?\n→ Quick View puts everything on one page.\n→ Ctrl/Cmd + K searches projects, companies and files.\n\nProjects marked \"sample\" are placeholder content shipped with the site\nto demonstrate the layout. Real work replaces them in\nsrc/content/portfolio.json."
    },
